OL,3,GNEWSAPuppet show tells story of girl
OL,4,Aescaping Nazis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA puppet show telling the story of a
OL,7,FCzech-Jewish girl escaping on a
OL,8,FKindertransport train in the 1930s is
OL,9,Fcoming to a museum.
OL,11,FKinder, a show using table-top puppetry
OL,12,Fand shadow play, tells the story of
OL,13,FBabi, who travels across Europe and
OL,14,Fdiscovers how tiny acts of kindness can
OL,15,Fchange the course of a person's life.
OL,17,FKindertransport was the name given to
OL,18,Fthe mission which took thousands of
OL,19,Fchildren to safety ahead of World War
OL,20,FTwo.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
